==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} ''[[hvítr]]''.

===Adjective===
{{is-adj-01|hvít|hvítt|hvítari|hvítastur}}

# [[white]]
#: ''Hún var '''hvít''' sem snjór.''
#:: She was '''white''' as snow.

====Derived terms====
* [[hrímhvítur]] {{m}}, [[hrímhvít]] {{f}}, [[hrímhvítt]] {{n}}
